							<span class="dot" style="background:#2E7FFF;"></span>
							<span>Representative manufacturing &amp; partner locations</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div id="enabling-operational" class="beat">
					<h3><GradientText>Enabl</GradientText>ing Operational Success</h3>
					<p class="beat__lede">
						We've deployed technology at scale, and we know exactly where the learning curve
						bites. We shorten it — integrating with the OSS/BSS systems and operational backbone
						your team already runs on, so growth doesn't stall at the handoff from engineering to
						operations.
					</p>
					<div class="map-card">
						<img src="/operational-growth.gif" alt="Deployment footprint growing over time" class="growth-gif" />
						<div class="map-card__caption">
							<span class="dot" style="background:#2E7FFF;"></span>
							<span>Deployed and scaling — new regions added every year</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div id="enabling-you" class="beat beat--you">
					<h3><GradientText>Enabl</GradientText>ing You</h3>
					<p class="beat__lede">
						Wherever your program is today — concept, prototype, or scaling past its first
						deployment — that's where we start. Reach out and see what enabling looks like for
						your product.
					</p>
					<Button href="/contact">Start a conversation</Button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- services -->
	<section class="services">
		<div class="section-heading">
			<h2>What we do</h2>
			<p>Full-stack telecom engineering — from a rough concept to a deployment-ready product.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="services__grid">
			<Card>
				<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
					<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" stroke="#FF2FD6" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
