				<h3>Mechanical Design</h3>
				<p>Enclosure, thermal, and mechanical engineering built around the constraints that actually matter.</p>
			</Card>
			<Card>
				<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
