				<p>Architecture, simulation, and design work from sub-6 GHz through mmWave.</p>
			</Card>
			<Card>
				<svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
					<rect x="3" y="4" width="6" height="6" rx="1.3" stroke="#9B3EE8" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
